Package: cybroid-edition-classroom
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://cybroid.com/cybroidos
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: cybroid-plasma (>= @VERSION@), veyon-service, veyon-master, kiwix, gcompris-qt, tuxpaint, tuxmath, ktouch, kturtle, thonny, geogebra, kbruch, cantor, kalzium, avogadro, step, stellarium, marble, kgeography, parley, openboard, audacity
Description: CybroidOS Classroom: for school computer rooms
 Every lab computer the same and ready for the next class: Veyon lets
 the teacher see, lock and guide every screen; student accounts in the
 "lab" group are reset to a clean state at each start. Kiwix opens
 Wikipedia and other libraries without the internet; OpenBoard is an
 interactive whiteboard for the teacher. Learning apps: GCompris, Tux
 Paint and TuxMath for young learners; KTouch for typing; KTurtle and
 Thonny for programming; GeoGebra, KBruch and Cantor for mathematics;
 Kalzium and Avogadro for chemistry; Step for physics; Stellarium for
 astronomy; Marble and KGeography for geography; Parley for vocabulary;
 Audacity for recording. Scratch installs from the App Centre.
 .
 The same CybroidOS as every edition (look, updates, Hangar), with these
 tools added. An installed CybroidOS becomes this edition by installing this
 package; several editions can be installed together.
